Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(怒视)既然米扎艾尔来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就再也不能失败了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次再搞砸的话我们就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么办？阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)这还用说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正面决胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把星光体和九十九游马打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正面决胜负!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明白吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是输了的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！我知道啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但不是那么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟那家伙的决斗 我想赌上一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全力去拼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.65,0:01:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你根本不明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你根本不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)喂 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底要吃到什么时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)要迟到了 迟到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)糟 糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我出门了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的… 出院之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋程度又加重了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)不过 嘛 他变回平时那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋样子 我就放心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)今天开始就要上学了吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等您很久了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.84,0:01:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么等了很久 这不是要迟到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:01:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙 到底是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)游马 他们全都是巴利安的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不能把真月卷进来……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 是 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)阿里特啊……果然我还是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要亲手来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确保万无一失 九十九游马打倒星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜我们面前 新的敌人异晶界人出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连 No.都能破坏的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 强力的 超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向我们袭来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能输啊。上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.77,0:02:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气燃起来！ 我＞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)璃绪早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，今天开始要去学校了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过现在这时候，他大概正喊着“要迟到了～”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼命跑着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}危险。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？璃绪小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无数敌意逼近而来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马有危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.27,0:05:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～ 被包围了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么多数量 要一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都对付吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要是输了的话 星光体就……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨、鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 用来做早上的运动倒是刚刚好呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟小姐 璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会手下留情哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把你们打成碎渣。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那真是感激不尽～。感谢感激啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙/游马)决斗镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙 还有他妹妹。真是麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 那就只好拿出杀手锏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 大老爷们 大老鼠。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～ 别磨磨蹭蹭的放马过来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)上吧 希尔菲妮 直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 下一位是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 嘎嘎嘎嘎曼！ 直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。 喂 真月 没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是觉得这样比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都是为了巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月？喂，真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是那时候的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在运动决斗大会上。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}问我为什么，你还没搞明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看这张卡也该懂了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，难道说这个男人是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那么说，是你把大家变成了这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:08:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，我的名字叫基拉格。是巴利安的战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上吧。你们几个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把九十九游马和星光体给我彻底击溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉格）来吧，召唤怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵，九十九游马、星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你们也完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马。要是被这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽攻击的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 对九十九游马 直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法闪电一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在被攻击的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌支付3000生命值发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那次战斗无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 你没事吧？ 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能。为什么是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 脑力重启。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000以下的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部返回手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予其等级乘以500的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这股力量……难道他是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你这家伙！阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋，忘了吗，我们的使命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了拯救我们的世界，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要「No.」这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有忘。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安！？你是巴利安？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那为什么你要妨碍我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了。我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要用正面决斗打倒那些家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！不管用什么手段，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都必须赢才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没小看他！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要用最强的决斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将我认可的最强决斗者击败，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我在成为异晶人之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个决斗者啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要用决斗来做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切 都用决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古 你所做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不是决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我决斗 你不会逃避吧？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！ 我们和身为异晶人的你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗 就意味着…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 No.… 不
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将是一场赌上彼此存在的战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:12:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。我只是 想和你们进行决斗而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 还有 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特… 那个人也能看见星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，他的决心不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样都是必须一战的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了，我来打。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然要打就和星光体一起，绝对要赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在等这句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界领域，展开！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，游马尽情地决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。上了，阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么，你会是异晶人。为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我。我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 燃烧拳击手 护头拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且通过放弃这个回合的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这家伙从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 燃烧拳击手 拳击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一回合不能攻击这件事竟然反过来利用……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的护头拳手和拳击手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 燃烧拳击手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拘束蛮兵 利刃拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 和那时候一样的怪兽。啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你明白的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个利刃拳手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏 而且
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每减少一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力就提升800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅不会被战斗破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力还会上升的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上三张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那盖卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道他想制造出和上次一样的情况……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击接反击的互拼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时的兴奋感还深深烙印在我体内！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他打算再一次用同样的战术来做个了断……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你在干什么游马！放马过来！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！不管有什么样的战术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在等着我，我都奉陪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，当我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有4星以上的我我我怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 我我我小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动我我我小子的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽特殊召唤成功时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成和我我我魔术师一样的等级4！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.61,0:15:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我小子叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于来了啊 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我盖上3张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 你也是想重现那时候的决斗吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁知道呢。嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦对 在这之前发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放·闪亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个时机发动速攻魔法！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是把我场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽作为超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只怪兽的效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，身为 No.怪兽的你的霍普也
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能被破坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且随着领袖之翼的超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减少了1个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会上升800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来我们被抢先一步了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们盖放的卡中的一张燃烧的斗志。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方怪兽的攻击力上升时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己怪兽的攻击力变为2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.26,0:17:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 刚刚盖放的这个回合不能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让利德布罗的攻击力提升
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被允许了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我 对这场决斗献上一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也全力放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 利德布罗攻击 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这招是上次攻击的重现 既然如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 陷阱发动 战斗·突袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次战斗 我的怪兽不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个数值的伤害给予你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然你也 和那时一样用那张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 反击陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加速·步法 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将战斗中发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:18:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就用和那时一样的这张卡来做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 超越·交错 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在怪兽超越之间战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的陷阱卡发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那家伙的发动和效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组抽1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是怪兽卡的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到战斗结束将怪兽的攻击力互换{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将对手怪兽的攻击力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上次 那家伙虽然让我吃了个亏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次可不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动更进一步的反击陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击·高等！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的反击！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手发动的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.17,0:18:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且而且 这场战斗受到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对玩家的伤害 变为２倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力差是 500！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 是1000点的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.85,0:18:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 领导冲拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿希望 贯穿游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪电一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.74,0:19:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害。好厉害啊 有码。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 你的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会让人不由自主地拼上全力。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 游马。 然后 让我们好好享受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全力碰撞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 全力享受吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}享受决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！ 我会全力享受的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡 超量·复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.19,0:19:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方场上的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材有1个以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地选1只怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 夺取对方怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材1个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其变成复活的霍普的素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 由于利德布罗的超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减少了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升800点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！ 领导蜂的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又上升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 燃烧的斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方怪兽的攻击力上升时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为我们怪兽的装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让装备怪兽的攻击力变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 希望皇！ 攻击领导蜂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 双重闪光斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就这样一口气压制住！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 胜负 现在才要开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 还没结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！我们的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在才要开始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊…呵呵，上吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 阿里特互相吸引的两人。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗的前方究竟会有什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.23,0:22:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份痛楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然…是这个场地…》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.03,0:23:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
